'''Ogress Warriors''' are found in the [[Corsair Cove Dungeon]]. They are a good way for free-to-play [[ironmen]] to obtain [[rune battleaxe]]s and [[rune full helm]]s, as well as [[Law rune|law]] and [[nature rune]]s.

Note that they have somewhat higher defence than [[lesser demon]]s (especially magical defence), so 45+ [[Ranged]] or 13+ [[Magic]] is recommended if you are safespotting.

They can be used as an effective alternative to [[Ogre]]s for a Slayer task, as the [[Corsair Cove Resource Area]] entrance is typically not crowded on members worlds.

==Locations==
On [[free-to-play]] worlds, the [[Corsair Curse]] quest must be started to travel to [[Corsair Cove]].
